# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored; never commit a real key.
#
# Optional. With a key, "Ask the agent" runs the live Muse Spark agent through the
# server route (app/api/agent/route.ts); the key stays on the server and is never
# sent to the browser. Without it the app opens in labeled Replay mode: the
# simulator still runs live and the recorded agent session is verified against it.
#
# Get a key from the Meta Model API: https://dev.meta.ai
MODEL_API_KEY=

# Hosted replay copy only. Never set these on your own machine.
#   REPLAY_ONLY=1               server: /api/agent refuses every request, even if a key is present
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_REPLAY_ONLY=1   build time: disables "Ask the agent" and shows why
# REPLAY_ONLY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REPLAY_ONLY=
